  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5501.06 \"List\" means the document that is available to the public as provided in RSA 651-B:7 and maintained by the department based upon sexual offender or offender against children registration information collected and verified by the local law enforcement agency.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99, EXPIRED: 7-28-07\n\nNew. #10121, eff 4-25-12 (from Saf-C 5501.05); ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
